<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/msa@/~cl_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "7" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/19/msa@> .
